{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>For Moses is late</b> — defective vav, to say that six hours had passed." "<b>is late</b> — two times in the Masorah: this one, and the other: מדוע בשש רכבו — just as there it means died, so too here they thought he had died, as the Sages said: the Satan showed them the form of his bed in the heaven. כי זה משה האיש אשר העלנו מארץ מצרים לא ידענו מה היה לו — in gematria: שהראה להם השטן מטתו של משה רבינו."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:53.117291344Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}